  "problem": "$\\sqrt{8}=$",
  "worked_solution": "The square root of a product of two positive numbers is equal to the product of the square roots of the numbers. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{8}=\\sqrt{4\\cdot 2}=\\sqrt{4}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}=2\\sqrt{2}.\n$$",
